label diagnose_failed
OW (frown): Are you not finished yet? I'm sorry, but unfortunately, I need to hurry home.
OW (neutral): I may return another time.
[signal arg="day_failed"]
jump timeline_end
label diagnose_correct
MC (neutral_closed): (The initial work program's installer must've had those extra useless startup programs bundled in.)
MC (neutral_closed): (And those "cleaning tools"... those are adware...)
MC (frown): (Forget cleaning- these apps are making it worse...)
